        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2debbe58-179d-43d1-abd4-5c8430caa8c0).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47, i have another job for you located at the GAMA private hospital. Your targets are &quot;Nicholas Laurent&quot; Chief Surgeon of GAMA, and &quot;Akira Nakamura&quot; Director of the Hospital. Nicholas Laurent was contracted and marked for death, by his close friend, who so happens to be a helicopter pilot dubbed &quot;Nails&quot; who was supposedly caught in giving Nicholas &quot;Drugs&quot;, and now wants him dead. While Akiea Nakamura was found to have 34 GB of Blackmail on his staff, so plan carefully 47, good luck.",
